	)
	(text "COMPONENT NOTES:\n\nR1, R2, R3, (discharges big filter caps) use 2W at least Resistors.\nFor all other resistors, use 1/4W.\nAll resistors are metal film, 1% or better tolerance.\n\nAll screw terminals (J2, J3, J4. J5, J9, J10) are the Phoenix Contact MKDS 1,5 series, 5.08mm pin pitch.\nPin headers (J6, J7, J8, J11, J12, J13) are standard 2.54mm pin pitch male pin headers.\n\nRegulators (U1, U2, U3) are all TO-220 3 pin package.\nHeatsinks used are Same Sky Devices HSE-B20254-035H-01."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 189.738 234.696 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
